    "not_charged_here": "Extra bracing on a line already charged as scrim. The Helen Park BSF compound fence went in on 11 Sep (docket 36504) at 72.5 m, braced and scrimmed, and is charged as scrim at 72.5 m there; iEDM's CW6 plan has it as 67 m braced for scrim, bracing on the inside. This docket adds 9 braces (18 bases, 18 clamps) to the same panels — no mesh panels, so no new fence and no new metres — and the 2026 card has no per-brace line. Charging scrim metres again would bill the same 72.5 m twice. Recorded as the crew's work on 17 Sep; nothing to add to the sheet. Reading of 19 Sep 2026; Andrew Fisher signed the docket on 19 Sep and can say otherwise.",
    "components": {
     "base": 18,
     "clamp": 18,
     "brace": 18
    },
